---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { products, site } from '../data/site';

const description =
  '参与 Beastry：从 GitHub 看想法、可帮忙的 Issue 和已合并的改动。提交和表态都在 GitHub 上完成。';
const descriptionEn =
  'Take part in Beastry. Ideas, issues you can help with, and merged changes are read from GitHub. Submitting and reacting happen on GitHub.';

const storyIssue = 'https://github.com/Beastry/ideas/issues/new?title=%5BStory%5D%20';
const beasts = 'https://github.com/Beastry/brand/blob/main/guidelines/04-fable-beasts.md';
---

<Base title="参与" titleEn="Take part" description={description} descriptionEn={descriptionEn}>
  <article class="page">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="kicker"><span lang="zh-Hans">参与</span><span lang="en">Take part</span></p>
      <h1><span lang="zh-Hans">参与 Beastry</span><span lang="en">Take part</span></h1>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        这一页从 GitHub 读正在收集的想法、标了 help wanted 或 good first issue 的 Issue，以及最近合并的改动。提交、+1 和留言都在 GitHub 上完成。本站没有账号，没有论坛，也不在这里记投票。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        This page reads open ideas, issues labeled help wanted or good first issue, and recently merged changes from GitHub. Submitting, adding +1, and commenting happen on GitHub. There is no account, no forum, and no vote stored here.
      </p>

      <h2><span lang="zh-Hans">提案还不是正式作品</span><span lang="en">A proposal is not a product yet</span></h2>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        正式作品在 <a href="/projects">作品</a>。母品牌的粉兔、蓝猫、黄熊写在
        <a href={beasts} rel="noreferrer">Beastry/brand 的寓言三兽</a>。一条 Issue 在维护者另作决定之前，不是正式资产，也不把权利转给 Beastry。本站没有权利转让表单。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        The products are on <a href="/projects">Works</a>. The pink rabbit, blue cat, and yellow bear are described in
        <a href={beasts} rel="noreferrer">Beastry/brand’s fable beasts</a>. An issue is not an official asset, and it does not transfer rights to Beastry, unless a maintainer decides that later. This site has no assignment form.
      </p>

      <h2><span lang="zh-Hans">从哪里开始</span><span lang="en">Where to start</span></h2>
      <div class="path-grid">
        <section class="path-card">
          <h3><span lang="zh-Hans">一个新想法</span><span lang="en">A new idea</span></h3>
          <p lang="zh-Hans">用 Beastry/ideas 的模板。打开后在 GitHub 用你自己的账号提交。</p>
          <p lang="en">Use the Beastry/ideas template. It opens GitHub, and you submit with your own account.</p>
          <p><a class="button primary" href={site.ideaIssue} rel="noreferrer"><span lang="zh-Hans">打开想法模板</span><span lang="en">Open the idea template</span></a></p>
        </section>
        <section class="path-card">
          <h3><span lang="zh-Hans">角色或故事</span><span lang="en">A character or story</span></h3>
          <p lang="zh-Hans">没有单独模板。这个链接只在空白 Issue 里预填标题 <code>[Story]</code>。它仍是讨论，不是正式标志。</p>
          <p lang="en">There is no separate template. This link only prefills <code>[Story]</code> on a blank GitHub issue. It stays a discussion, not an official mark.</p>
          <p><a class="button ghost" href={storyIssue} rel="noreferrer"><span lang="zh-Hans">写一条故事 Issue</span><span lang="en">Open a story issue</span></a></p>
        </section>
        <section class="path-card">
          <h3><span lang="zh-Hans">已有的作品</span><span lang="en">An existing app</span></h3>
          <p lang="zh-Hans">问题和建议去 <a href="/help">帮助</a>。代码用那个仓库的 Pull Request 交回。</p>
          <p lang="en">Bugs and suggestions start at <a href="/help">Help</a>. Code comes back as a pull request to that repository.</p>
          <p><a class="button ghost" href="#tasks"><span lang="zh-Hans">看任务入口</span><span lang="en">See the task links</span></a></p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <h2 id="ideas"><span lang="zh-Hans">正在收集的想法</span><span lang="en">Ideas being collected</span></h2>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        打开页面时从 <a href={`${site.ideas}/issues`} rel="noreferrer">Beastry/ideas</a> 读取。+1 是 GitHub 上的反应，只表示兴趣，不改变优先级。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        Read from <a href={`${site.ideas}/issues`} rel="noreferrer">Beastry/ideas</a> when the page opens. A +1 is a GitHub reaction. It shows interest and does not change priority.
      </p>
      <div id="idea-board">
        <p lang="zh-Hans">实时列表由页面打开后向 GitHub 读取。读不到时，记录仍在上面的 Issues 链接里。</p>
        <p lang="en">The live list is requested from GitHub after the page opens. If that read fails, the record is still at the issues link above.</p>
      </div>

      <h2 id="tasks"><span lang="zh-Hans">可以帮忙的任务</span><span lang="en">Tasks you can pick up</span></h2>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        本站不另存一份任务清单。下面是各仓库的入口，然后查询当前带 <code>help wanted</code> 或 <code>good first issue</code> 的 Issue。没有就显示没有。要说你在做，请在那条 Issue 下留言。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        This site does not keep its own task list. The repository links come first, then a query for open issues labeled <code>help wanted</code> or <code>good first issue</code>. No result means none. To say you are doing the work, comment on that issue.
      </p>
      <ul class="help-list">
        {
          products.map((product) => (
            <li>
              <h3>{product.name}</h3>
              <p class="project-links">
                <a href={`${product.github}/issues`} rel="noreferrer">Issues</a>
                {' · '}
                <a href={`${product.github}/pulls`} rel="noreferrer">Pull requests</a>
                {product.extraLinks?.map((link) => (
                  <>
                    {' · '}
                    <a href={link.href} rel={link.href.startsWith('http') ? 'noreferrer' : undefined}>
                      <span lang="zh-Hans">{link.zh}</span>
                      <span lang="en">{link.en}</span>
                    </a>
                  </>
                ))}
              </p>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
      <div id="task-board">
        <p lang="zh-Hans">带标签的任务在页面打开后向 GitHub 查询。</p>
        <p lang="en">Labeled tasks are requested from GitHub after the page opens.</p>
      </div>

      <h2 id="delivered"><span lang="zh-Hans">最近合并的改动</span><span lang="en">Recently merged changes</span></h2>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        这里是 GitHub 上已合并的 Pull Request。合并只说明改动进了仓库，不是把它收成正式品牌资产，也不转移权利。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        These are pull requests GitHub already merged. A merge means the change landed in a repository. It does not make the work an official brand asset, and it does not transfer rights.
      </p>
      <div id="pull-board">
        <p lang="zh-Hans">已合并的记录在页面打开后向 GitHub 查询。</p>
        <p lang="en">Merged records are requested from GitHub after the page opens.</p>
      </div>

      <h2><span lang="zh-Hans">谁来发出</span><span lang="en">Who sends it</span></h2>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        提交、+1 和留言要用一个负责的人自己的 GitHub 账号。代理可以起草，发出仍要这个人来。合并、发布和权限由仓库维护者决定。步骤在
        <a href="/agents">Agent 说明</a>，索引在 <a href="/llms.txt">/llms.txt</a>。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        Submitting, adding +1, and commenting use a responsible person’s own GitHub account. An agent may draft the words. That person still sends them. Merges, releases, and permissions stay with the repository maintainer. The steps are in
        <a href="/agents">For agents</a>. The index is <a href="/llms.txt">/llms.txt</a>.
      </p>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        未登录时，读取大约每小时 60 次，搜索大约每分钟 10 次，按来访者的网络计算。到上限时列表会说读不到，上面的 GitHub 链接仍可用。写信：
        <a href="mailto:community@beastry.app">community@beastry.app</a>。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        Signed-out reads are about 60 an hour, and searches about 10 a minute, counted on the visitor’s network. At the limit the list says GitHub could not be read, and the links above still work. Write to
        <a href="mailto:community@beastry.app">community@beastry.app</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<script>
  import { loadCommunity, renderIdeas, renderPulls, renderTasks, type BoardState, type Lang } from '../lib/cocreate';

  const ideaBoard = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#idea-board');
  const taskBoard = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#task-board');
  const pullBoard = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#pull-board');
  let state: BoardState | null = null;

  function language(): Lang {
    return document.documentElement.dataset.lang === 'en' ? 'en' : 'zh';
  }

  function paint() {
    const lang = language();
    if (!state || !ideaBoard || !taskBoard || !pullBoard) return;
    ideaBoard.innerHTML = renderIdeas(state.ideas, lang);
    taskBoard.innerHTML = renderTasks(state.tasks, lang);
    pullBoard.innerHTML = renderPulls(state.pulls, lang);
  }

  loadCommunity(fetch)
    .then((next) => {
      state = next;
      paint();
    })
    .catch(() => {
      state = { ideas: { status: 'unavailable' }, tasks: { status: 'unavailable' }, pulls: { status: 'unavailable' } };
      paint();
    });

  new MutationObserver(paint).observe(document.documentElement, {
    attributes: true,
    attributeFilter: ['data-lang'],
  });
</script>
